{"content":[{"c":["SEGUB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Youngest son of Hiel the Bethelite. Hiel rebuilt Jericho during the reign of King Ahab of Israel. His violation of Joshua’s curse against anyone rebuilding the city (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.6.26","r":"Josh.6.26","rawR":"Josh.6.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.6.26","value":"Josh.6.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 6:26"},") cost him his oldest and youngest sons. Segub was killed as a result of the rebuilding of the city gates (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.16.34","r":"1Kgs.16.34","rawR":"1Kgs.16.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.16.34","value":"1Kgs.16.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 16:34"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Son borne to Hezron by the daughter of Makir, the father of Gilead. Segub was the father of Jair (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.21-22","r":"1Chr.2.21-22","rawR":"1Chr.2.21-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.21-22","value":"1Chr.2.21-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:21-22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Segub","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 6:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.6.26","rawQueryValue":"Josh.6.26","sourceRefExact":"Josh.6.26"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 16:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.16.34","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.16.34","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.16.34"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:21-22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.21-22","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.21-22","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.21-22"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"a2586a7d7922953445e7fe6a2ef29e927a8acd02f22766a8cf933fd948c33067","sourceItemName":"Segub","sourceItemOrder":133,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Segub","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Segub","title":"Segub","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}